Alembic migrations for the MedSeal database (PostgreSQL in production, SQLite for the offline demo).

The app applies them itself on startup (app/db.py: init_engine). By hand, from backend/:

    .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head                                # MEDSEAL_DB_URL picks the database
    .venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"   # after editing app/models.py

Never edit a revision that has been released; add a new one.
